  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>Super RPG 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">說明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">您的原版遊戲體驗將因這款現代、獨特且易於閱讀的流暢風格字型而進一步提升。此字型專為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計，現已開放給大眾使用！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型以 Jovanny Lemonad 設計的熱門 Google 字型 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Russo One\" rel=\"nofollow\">Russo One</a> 為基礎。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型採用開放字型授權（Open Font License）釋出。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/634/russo-one-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>遊戲截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/413/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/414/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/412/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/552/415/2022-12-17_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即購買伺服器，與好友同樂！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
